      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Armor Training.</strong> You gain training with Heavy armor.</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency.</strong> You gain proficiency with Smith's Tools. If you already have it, you gain proficiency with one other type of Artisan's Tools of your choice.</p><p><strong>Armor Crafting.</strong> When you craft nonmagical or magic armor, the time it takes is halved.</p>",
